I've been there before. And being chaotic it'll even be tougher for you.

First take a read of the appeasment FAQ here:

http://www.nethack.de/spoiler/appeasement.txt

Don't bother offering up anything that isn't on the chaotic list.

There's really only three ways to solve your problem:

1) Find a co-aligned altar deep in the dungeon and sacrifice something
on the list on that altar.

2) Find a figurine of one other monsters and apply it. Make sure it isn't
blessed because you may get a pet.

3) The most common is to secure teleport control, kill the monster deep
in the mines and level teleport it to the Dlvl1 altar. Tools include a BoH

I've pulled off the last one once. My wizard killed a Umber Hulk around
level 21, and level teleported it to a upper level altar. No better words
to hear than:

"<Your god> seems mollified."

